.\" MiniBrowser - user manual
.\"
.TH MINI-BROWSER 1 "2026-05-04" "1.0.0" "MiniBrowser User Manual"
.SH NAME
mini-browser \- A small but full-featured web browser built with PyQt6 + QtWebEngine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mini-browser
[\fI\,URL\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
MiniBrowser is a lightweight desktop web browser that supports tabbed browsing,
bookmarks, history, download management, proxy configuration, and developer
tools. It uses the QtWebEngine (Chromium) rendering engine for modern web
compatibility.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI URL
Optional URL to open on startup. If omitted, the default homepage is loaded.
.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B Multi-tab browsing
Open multiple tabs with drag-and-drop reordering.
.TP
.B Bookmarks
Save and organize your favourite websites.
.TP
.B History
SQLite-backed browsing history with full-text search.
.TP
.B Download manager
Track download progress with an in-app manager.
.TP
.B Proxy support
Configure HTTP or SOCKS5 proxy through the settings dialog.
.TP
.B Search engines
Choose between Google, Bing, DuckDuckGo, and Baidu.
.TP
.B Dark theme
Built-in dark colour scheme for comfortable browsing.
.TP
.B Developer tools
Open Chromium DevTools with F12.
.TP
.B i18n
Multi-language support via gettext. Set the LANG environment variable to
switch languages (e.g., LANG=zh_CN.UTF-8 mini-browser).
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+T
Open a new tab
.TP
.B Ctrl+N
Open a new window
.TP
.B Ctrl+W
Close the current tab
.TP
.B Ctrl+S
Save the current page as HTML
.TP
.B Ctrl+P
Print the current page to PDF
.TP
.B Ctrl+H
Show browsing history
.TP
.B Ctrl+B
Manage bookmarks
.TP
.B Ctrl+D
Add the current page to bookmarks
.TP
.B Ctrl+J
Open download manager
.TP
.B Ctrl+,
Open settings
.TP
.B F12
Toggle developer tools
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/share/mini-browser/main.py
The main application script.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/MiniBrowser/history.db
SQLite database storing browsing history.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/MiniBrowser/bookmarks.json
JSON file storing bookmarks.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B LANG
Language code for i18n (e.g., zh_CN.UTF-8 for Chinese, de_DE.UTF-8 for German).
.SH BUGS
Report bugs to: https://github.com/LiangXiangan/mini-browser/issues
